.TH ROULETTE 1 "November 2026" "roulette 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
roulette \- spin a wheel of harmless, read-only commands and run the winner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B roulette
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B roulette
displays a reel of shell commands scrolling past a pointer. The reel slows
to a stop, lands on one command, and then executes it.
.PP
Every command on the wheel is read-only and non-destructive \(em listing
files, showing the date, reporting disk usage, memory, processes, and the
like. A spin can never modify files, change system state, or send data over
the network, so it is always safe to run.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
Spin and pick a command, but do not execute it.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-list
List every command on the wheel and exit.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pick ", " \-f ", " \-\-fast
Skip the spin animation and run the winner immediately.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-wheel
Keep the full wheel on screen after it lands. By default the wheel collapses
once the spin stops, leaving just the result and the command's output.
.TP
.B \-\-russian
Add a \(lqrussian roulette\(rq slot to the wheel. If the spin lands on it,
every file and folder in the current directory is moved to the trash. This is
opt-in, recoverable (it uses the desktop trash, not \fBrm\fR), and asks for
confirmation before deleting anything. Without this flag the wheel holds only
read-only commands and can never delete.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Disable ANSI colors.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECS"
Seconds to allow the winning command to run (default: 15).
.TP
.BI \-\-seed " N"
Seed the random generator for a reproducible spin.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a help message and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
If set, colors are disabled (same as \fB\-\-no\-color\fR).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns the exit status of the executed command, or 0 for
.BR \-\-list " / " \-\-dry\-run .
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B roulette
Spin the wheel and run the winning command.
.TP
.B roulette \-\-dry\-run
See what it would land on without running anything.
.SH AUTHOR
roulette contributors.
